 "¿Te habrías embarcado en un drakkar? (1 = jamás, 5 = ¡ya!)": "Would you have boarded a longship? (1 = never, 5 = right now!)",
 "Modelos 3D: Bárbaro — KayKit — Kay Lousberg, kaylousberg.com (CC0-1.0)": "3D models: Barbarian — KayKit — Kay Lousberg, kaylousberg.com (CC0-1.0)",
 "La Ruta de la Seda": "The Silk Road",
 "La caravana cruza la portada despacio, ella sola. La ruta no era un camino único, sino una red de caminos entre China y el Mediterráneo; el nombre se lo puso un geógrafo en el siglo XIX.": "The caravan crosses the title slide slowly, all by itself. The route wasn't a single road but a network of routes between China and the Mediterranean; the name was coined by a geographer in the 19th century.",
