 "<div style=\"font-size:90px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.05;color:#6b3e26\">200</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">granos de cacao costaba un pavo</div>": "<div style=\"font-size:90px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.05;color:#6b3e26\">200</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">cacao beans was the price of a turkey</div>",
 "Con el cacao también se preparaba una bebida amarga y espumosa: el antepasado del chocolate.": "Cacao was also used to make a bitter, frothy drink: the ancestor of chocolate.",
